ous namespace)::Worker::Execute()\n    @     0x55ff9e690e84  yb::thread::SuperviseThread()\n    @     0x7f60fd88a19a  start_thread\n    @     0x7f60fd90f210  __clone3\n```\nPrior state was:\n```\nI1020 19:49:05.130321 1747371 tablet_peer.cc:487] T a9719be54b47458590108bd82ddcd903 P 2b5326446199451fbceb0f7fcb3d5f55 [state=NOT_STARTED]: Initiating TabletPeer shutdown\nI1020 19:49:05.130324 1747371 tablet_peer.cc:505] T a9719be54b47458590108bd82ddcd903 P 2b5326446199451fbceb0f7fcb3d5f55 [state=QUIESCING]: Started shutdown from state: NOT_STARTED\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-18779]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-18779?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"yusong-yan","id":46516278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE2Mjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46516278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan","html_url":"https://github.com/yusong-yan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29022/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"l